  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 68b17a837ee29b942a5a85513233c468, type: 3}
  m_Name: Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  actors: 
  Dialogue:
  - '[???]:

    Wait, don''t go!'
  - Woah, what the- Who are ya? What are ya?
  - As the strange being approaches your eyes focus on what appears to be a... fairy?
  - '[???]:

    I''m not a fairy! I''m far more powerful than Tooth or Bel - I''ll
    have you know. '
  - "Ya didn't answer my question, Not-Fairy.\t"
  - '[Not-Fairy]:

    Just call me <b>Yota</b> for now and Yota needs you to get
    up... like right now.'
  - It's a Saturday. I was about to take a nap- y'know?
  - '[Not-Fairy]: You''re a rat, for Toys'' sake! You have no concept of a weekend.'
  - Fair point. What d'ya want, o powerful Not-Fairy?
  - 'You know who''s ceiling you''re living in - don''t you?. I know rats aren''t
    the brightest... or the cleanest or the nicest or the - '
  - What's your point?
  - Right, sorry. Stupid mouth, stupid mouth.
  - Thought I was the one who ain't "the brightest".
  - I never said I was either but that's beside's the point! Stop distracting me!
    I need your help with fixing something.
  - Don't know if you remember but I ain't the brightest and I ain't exactly a wiz
    with ma hands either, bed bug.
  - '[Bed Bug]: That''s why I''m here! The <b>little girl</b> who''s room you''re
    living in - <b>Gennifer</b> -  remember her? Well her <b>toy world</b> is disappearing.'
  - Toy world? Uh-huh.
  - Don't you sneak in here and look at her stuff? How do you live in her room and
    not know what toys are?
  - I ain't-
  - 'Right, right, " the brightest". You won''t let that one go - huh? Never mind.
    Point is - you have to help me - only you can. '
  - Oh yeah? And why's it have to be me?
  - Because! When the toy world disappears it <b>fractures and leaks into the real
    world</b> until nothing is left. Parts of the toy world here have already leaked
    into the real world.
  - The other toys can't interact with anything in this world and well, I'm not exactly
    from this world either, so enter Rat...
  - <b>Mochi's</b> the name... So, I'm the chosen hero that the whole of the toy
    world depends on, aint that right, fruit fly?
  - "[Fruit Fly]: \nYes! Exactly! Well, not exactly - just this little girl's toy
    world, not the whole of the toy world. They have me for that, hehe."
  - Well, that's fine and dandy 'cept I ain't no hero, dust mite. What's in it for
    me?
  - "[Dust Mite]: \nI'll pretend I didn't hear the \"dust mite.\" "
  - Called ya a bed bug and a fruit fly but dust mite is crossin' the line?
  - "[Not-Dust-Mite-Just-Yota]: \nYou've never wanted to go out there? Look at this
    place - it's nothing short of a void - I mean I can barely see you!"
  - You don't have any friends or family and I can bet a wing and ring that you're
    afraid of Gennifer. When was the last you looked at anything else other than
    these four corners and a block of cheese?
  - Gonna pretend I didn't hear the "cheese' stereotype. That's for mice - by the
    way.
  - Deflection, deflection - that's all I hear.
  - All right. All right. Might not be so bright, Yota but you've got keen observation
    skills. I'll help ya.
  - Yes! Thank you! If you weren't a disease infested rodent and I wasn't a holy
    celestial being I'd kiss you!
  - Sure, thanks. Let's just go before I change my mind.
  - 'Right, we have no time for a break. '
  - 'First, here''s <b>what you have to do</b>. Gennifer has a toy figurine named
    Jenni. Jenni''s toy spirit has already fractured into 5 pieces and leaked into
    the real world. '
  - You have to find all of her and bring her back to where her toy spirit was born
    before she disappears altogether.
  - Where her toy spirit was born?
  - 'I don''t know what it''s called in the real world but it''s where she stopped
    being just a toy and became part of a child''s imagination. <b>Without that imagination
    there would be no toy world</b>. '
  - Think of it as the place where Jenni first came out of so that our little girl
    and play with her for the first time.
  - Once you've done that I'll use my powers to help you imbue Jenni so you can interact
    with the other toys - which is another reason why we have to get to her first.
  - So, what you're gonna use your Not-Fairy magic and turn me into a doll?
  - "You're sarcastic but you're not far off- \n"
  - Ya gotta be kiddin' me-
  - Also, Jenni is a figurine, not a doll - two completely different things
  - Yeah, yeah, I got it. I got it. Can we go now?
